+- **Typed completion authority** — `structured-result`、`verified-claim`、`review-pass`、`human-approval` 將證據與 prose 分離。
+- **Machine-verifiable work** — exact commit SHA、branch/worktree、lease identity 與 evidence 都要驗證。
